<& "/page/page_title.mas", title => "How to Submit Data to T3" &>

<p>Follow these easy instrutions to submit your data <strong><em>in any format</em></strong> to the T3 Curators.</p>

<ol id="data-submission-steps">
    <li>Go to the correct T3 Database:
        <ul>
            <li><strong>T3/Wheat:</strong> <a href="https://wheat.triticeaetoolbox.org" target="_blank">https://wheat.triticeaetoolbox.org</a></li>
            <li><strong>T3/Oat:</strong> <a href="https://oat.triticeaetoolbox.org" target="_blank">https://oat.triticeaetoolbox.org</a></li>
            <li><strong>T3/Barley:</strong> <a href="https://barley.triticeaetoolbox.org" target="_blank">https://barley.triticeaetoolbox.org</a></li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>Click the <strong>Submit Data</strong> button on the T3 homepage.</p>
        <img src="/static_content/img/data-submission-1.png" style="width: 100%" />
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>Choose the type of data you want to submit.</p>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Phenotype Data:</strong> We can accept your data <strong><em>in any format</em></strong> and we'll convert it into the appropriate upload templates.</li>
            <li><strong>Genotype Data:</strong> We accept genotype data <strong><em>as .vcf files</em></strong>.</li>
        </ol>
        <img src="/static_content/img/data-submission-2.png" style="width: 100%" />
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>Fill out the submission form and upload your data files.</p>
        <video width="100%" controls autoplay loop>
            <source src="/static_content/img/data-submission-3.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>Once we receive your submission, we'll work on processing your data and we'll get in touch if we have any questions.</p>
    </li>
</ol>


<style>
    #data-submission-steps > li {
        margin: 30px 0;
    }
    #data-submission-steps img {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 800px;
        border: 1px solid #ccc;
        border-radius: 5px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        margin: 15px auto;
        display: block;
    }
</style>